946
01:05:31,840 --> 01:05:32,440
That's true.

947
01:05:33,280 --> 01:05:34,880
I wasn't playing hard to get, Auntie!

948
01:05:35,200 --> 01:05:36,240
I just didn't like him!

949
01:05:37,480 --> 01:05:38,280
Stubborn, huh?

950
01:05:40,640 --> 01:05:41,920
He also talked about Khing.

951
01:05:42,640 --> 01:05:43,680
Khing...

952
01:05:43,880 --> 01:05:45,000
